{
  "id": "E373",
  "title": "Booking a Hotel Room",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-11-03",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s Dad is booking a hotel room. What are the useful expressions to learn from this?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50373/ce00dfc32bcf566ae76c8f9cfec2197802c909f0.mp3?1572261964",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "订酒店\n\n小明的爸爸：你好，我想订一个房间，就今晚。\n前台：好的，请问是几位客人入住？\n小明的爸爸：两个大人，一个小孩，有没有家庭房？\n前台：稍等，我帮您查询一下。抱歉，今天只有大床房了。您看给您加个床，可以吗？\n小明的爸爸：没问题。可以给我安排一个无烟房吗？\n前台：好的。一晚大床房加床，一共六百元。请问怎么支付？\n小明的爸爸：支付宝可以吗？\n前台：没问题，请扫这里。",
    "traditional": "訂酒店\n\n小明的爸爸：你好，我想訂一個房間，就今晚。\n前臺：好的，請問是幾位客人入住？\n小明的爸爸：兩個大人，一個小孩，有沒有家庭房？\n前臺：稍等，我幫您查詢一下。抱歉，今天只有大床房了。您看給您加個床，可以嗎？\n小明的爸爸：沒問題。可以給我安排一個無煙房嗎？\n前臺：好的。一晚大床房加床，一共六百元。請問怎麼支付？\n小明的爸爸：支付寶可以嗎？\n前臺：沒問題，請掃這裡。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Booking a hotel room"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：你好，我想订一个房间，就今晚。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：你好，我想訂一個房間，就今晚。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba nǐ hǎo wǒ xiǎng dìng yí ge fáng jiān jiù jīn wǎn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Hello, I want to book a room for tonight."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "前台：好的，请问是几位客人入住？",
      "traditional": "前臺：好的，請問是幾位客人入住？",
      "pinyin": "qián tái hǎo de qǐng wèn shì jǐ wèi kè rén rù zhù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Reception: Ok, may I ask how many guests are checking in?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：两个大人，一个小孩，有没有家庭房？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：兩個大人，一個小孩，有沒有家庭房？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba liǎng ge dà ren yí ge xiǎo hái yǒu méi yǒu jiā tíng fáng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Two adults and one child. Do you have a family room?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "前台：稍等，我帮您查询一下。抱歉，今天只有大床房了。",
      "traditional": "前臺：稍等，我幫您查詢一下。抱歉，今天只有大床房了。",
      "pinyin": "qián tái shāo děng wǒ bāng nín chá xún yí xià bào qiàn jīn tiān zhǐ yǒu dà chuáng fáng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "您看给您加个床，可以吗？",
      "traditional": "您看給您加個床，可以嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nín kàn gěi nín jiā ge chuáng kě yǐ ma",
      "english": "Reception: Wait a moment, I will check that for you. Sorry, there are only rooms with a double bed today."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "What do you think about if we got you an extra bed, would that work?"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：没问题。可以给我安排一个无烟房吗？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：沒問題。可以給我安排一個無煙房嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba méi wèn tí kě yǐ gěi wǒ ān pái yí ge wú yān fáng ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: No problem. Can you help me arrange a non-smoking room?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "前台：好的。一晚大床房加床，一共六百元。",
      "traditional": "前臺：好的。一晚大床房加床，一共六百元。",
      "pinyin": "qián tái hǎo de yì wǎn dà chuáng fáng jiā chuáng yí gòng liù bǎi yuán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "请问怎么支付？",
      "traditional": "請問怎麼支付？",
      "pinyin": "qǐng wèn zěn me zhī fù",
      "english": "Reception: Ok. One night in a double room with one extra bed. Six hundred yuan in total."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "May I ask how you would like to pay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：支付宝可以吗？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：支付寶可以嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba zhī fù bǎo kě yǐ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s Dad: Can I use Alipay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "前台：没问题，请扫这里。",
      "traditional": "前臺：沒問題，請掃這裡。",
      "pinyin": "qián tái méi wèn tí qǐng sǎo zhè lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Reception: No problem, please scan here."
    }
  ],
